[{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Write down the equation of the plane passing through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-1,8,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and perpendicular to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j+\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf r-\\mathbf a)\\cdot\\mathbf n=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\8\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>It is given that the planes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> have equations <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf r-\\mathbf i)\\cdot(2\\mathbf i+\\mathbf k)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf r-3\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\\cdot(6\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j+2\\mathbf k)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively. Find the acute angle between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in degrees to 1 decimal place.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\-1\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{2^2+0^2+1^2}\\times\\sqrt{6^2+(-1)^2+2^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{2\\times6+0\\times(-1)+1\\times2}{\\sqrt5\\times\\sqrt{41}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{205}}\\Rightarrow\\theta=12.094\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12.1^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>It is given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-6\\\\5\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>Show that the point with coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,\\frac85,7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the plane.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\\\frac85\\\\7\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-6\\\\5\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\-\\frac25\\\\10\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-6\\\\5\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(-2)\\times(-6)+\\left(-\\frac25\\right)\\times5+10\\times(-1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=12-2-10=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(3,\\frac85,7\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>It is given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-9\\\\8\\\\-16\\end{pmatrix}=6.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>Show that the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-5,-4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-5\\\\-4\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-9\\\\8\\\\-16\\end{pmatrix}=2\\times(-9)+(-5)\\times8+(-4)\\times(-16)=-18-40+64=6.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-5,-4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Write the equation of each of these planes in cartesian form, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ax+by+cz=d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a,b,c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf i=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf j=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf k=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(3\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j-3\\mathbf k)=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(10\\mathbf i-50\\mathbf j+25\\mathbf k)=30\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf i=2\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=2\\Rightarrow x=2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf j=0\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=0\\Rightarrow y=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf k=-3\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=-3\\Rightarrow z=-3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(3\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j-3\\mathbf k)=9\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}=9\\Rightarrow3x+2y-3z=9.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(10\\mathbf i-50\\mathbf j+25\\mathbf k)=30\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}10\\\\-50\\\\25\\end{pmatrix}=30\\Rightarrow10x-50y+25z=30.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x-10y+5z=6.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>It is given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is perpendicular to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j-10\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and contains the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,-6,8)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the vector equation for the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf n=p\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>The plane has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x-3y-10z=d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"d=2(3)-3(-6)-10(8)=-56.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore2x-3y-10z=-56.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-3\\\\-10\\end{pmatrix}=-56.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Find the acute angle between the following pairs of planes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1:\\mathbf r\\cdot(-\\mathbf i-2\\mathbf j+4\\mathbf k)=9,\\quad \\Pi_2:\\mathbf r\\cdot(3\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j+10\\mathbf k)=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1:\\mathbf r\\cdot(-5\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j-9\\mathbf k)=1,\\quad \\Pi_2:\\mathbf r\\cdot(16\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j-5\\mathbf k)=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\-2\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\1\\\\10\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{(-1)^2+(-2)^2+4^2}\\times\\sqrt{3^2+1^2+10^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{(-1)\\times3+(-2)\\times1+4\\times10}{\\sqrt{21}\\times\\sqrt{110}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{35}{\\sqrt{2310}}\\Rightarrow\\theta=43.262\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"43.3^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}-5\\\\-1\\\\-9\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\2\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{(-5)^2+(-1)^2+(-9)^2}\\times\\sqrt{16^2+2^2+(-5)^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{(-5)\\times16+(-1)\\times2+(-9)\\times(-5)}{\\sqrt{107}\\times\\sqrt{285}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=-\\frac{37}{\\sqrt{30495}}\\Rightarrow\\theta=102.232\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ-102.232\\ldots^\\circ=77.8^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>It is given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(3\\mathbf i-2\\mathbf j-10\\mathbf k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf k=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the acute angle between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-2\\\\-10\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{3^2+(-2)^2+(-10)^2}\\times\\sqrt{0^2+0^2+1^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{3\\times0+(-2)\\times0+(-10)\\times1}{\\sqrt{113}\\times\\sqrt1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=-\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{113}}\\Rightarrow\\theta=160.172\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ-160.172\\ldots^\\circ=19.8^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>It is given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is perpendicular to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j+\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and contains the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,3,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. It is also given that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is perpendicular to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j-2\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and contains the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,9,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the vector equation for the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf n=p\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the vector equation for the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf n=p\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the exact value of the cosine of the acute angle between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=2\\times8+3\\times(-1)+1\\times1=14.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1:\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=14.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\9\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=3\\times1+9\\times(-3)+2\\times(-2)=-28.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2:\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=-28.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{8^2+(-1)^2+1^2}\\times\\sqrt{1^2+(-3)^2+(-2)^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{8\\times1+(-1)\\times(-3)+1\\times(-2)}{\\sqrt{66}\\times\\sqrt{14}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac9{\\sqrt{924}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{231}}{154}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>A particle moves along a path relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with equation:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=(800t^2+540t-99)\\mathbf i+(300-20t)\\mathbf j+(800t^2+620t-133)\\mathbf k,\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the time in seconds and distances are measured in metres. A plane has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the exact time when the particle hits the plane.</p></li></ol><p>The particle has velocity (in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>) given by the following equation:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=(1600t+540)\\mathbf i-20\\mathbf j+(1600t+620)\\mathbf k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the direction of the particle when the particle hits the plane.</p></li><li><p>Find the acute angle at which the particle hits the plane, giving your answer in degrees to 1 decimal place.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}800t^2+540t-99\\\\300-20t\\\\800t^2+620t-133\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(800t^2+540t-99)\\times1+(300-20t)\\times0+(800t^2+620t-133)\\times(-1)=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow800t^2+540t-99-800t^2-620t+133=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-80t+34=0\\Rightarrow t=\\frac{17}{40}=0.425\\text{ seconds}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left.\\mathbf v\\right|_{t=\\frac{17}{40}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1600\\times\\frac{17}{40}+540\\\\-20\\times\\frac{17}{40}\\\\1600\\times\\frac{17}{40}+620\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1220\\\\-\\frac{17}{2}\\\\1300\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}1220\\\\-\\frac{17}{2}\\\\1300\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{1220^2+\\left(-\\frac{17}{2}\\right)^2+1300^2}\\times\\sqrt{1^2+0^2+(-1)^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1220\\times1+\\left(-\\frac{17}{2}\\right)\\times0+1300\\times(-1)}{\\sqrt{3178472.25}\\times\\sqrt2}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=-\\frac{80}{\\sqrt{6356944.5}}\\Rightarrow\\theta=91.818\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the acute angle between the particle and the normal vector to the plane is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ-91.818\\ldots^\\circ=88.181\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. So the acute angle between the particle and the plane is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"90^\\circ-88.181\\ldots^\\circ=1.8^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.58-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>The points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(150,0,-200)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(300,50,-150)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C(400,150,-300)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> all lie in the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the equation of the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf n=p\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the acute angle that the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> makes with the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\overrightarrow{OB}-\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\begin{pmatrix}300\\\\50\\\\-150\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}150\\\\0\\\\-200\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}150\\\\50\\\\50\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\overrightarrow{OC}-\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\begin{pmatrix}400\\\\150\\\\-300\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}150\\\\0\\\\-200\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}250\\\\150\\\\-100\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{pmatrix}150\\\\50\\\\50\\end{pmatrix}\\times\\begin{pmatrix}250\\\\150\\\\-100\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\mathbf i&amp;\\mathbf j&amp;\\mathbf k\\\\150&amp;50&amp;50\\\\250&amp;150&amp;-100\\end{vmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(50\\times(-100)-50\\times150)\\mathbf i-(150\\times(-100)-50\\times250)\\mathbf j+(150\\times150-50\\times250)\\mathbf k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-12500\\mathbf i+27500\\mathbf j+10000\\mathbf k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The plane has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-12500x+27500y+10000z=d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"d=-12500(150)+27500(0)+10000(-200)=-3875000.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore-12500x+27500y+10000z=-3875000.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-5x+11y+4z=-1550.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi:\\mathbf r\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-5\\\\11\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}=-1550\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}-5\\\\11\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}}{\\sqrt{(-5)^2+11^2+4^2}\\times\\sqrt{0^2+0^2+1^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac{(-5)\\times0+11\\times0+4\\times1}{\\sqrt{162}\\times\\sqrt1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cos\\theta=\\frac4{\\sqrt{162}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt2}{9}\\Rightarrow\\theta=71.683\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"71.7^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]}]